- This is general guidance. For precise tax calculations (exact student‑loan phaseout amount, exact taxable income, any state adjustments, and optimizing elections), consider using tax‑preparation software or consult a CPA or enrolled agent — especially if you want to minimize audit risk and ensure correct treatment of home office and self‑employment items.

