- Forms you’ll need: Form 1040, Schedule C (business income/expenses), Schedule SE (self‑employment tax), Schedule 1 (adjustments like student‑loan interest), and Form 8829 if you use the actual home‑office method. Schedule A only if you decide to itemize (unlikely). Arizona: Form 140 (state return).

1) Which items are deductible and how they are reported
- W‑2 wages (Metro Consulting $64,800): report on Form 1040 (W‑2 wages). Employee unreimbursed expenses for a W‑2 job are NOT deductible for 2018–2025 unless they qualify in a very narrow category (so if your $950 “unreimbursed expenses” are related to self‑employment, they’re deductible; if they are unreimbursed employee expenses for your W‑2 job, they are not deductible).
