- Not deductible federally. Business expenses = $4,053 (home office) only
- Net Schedule C profit = $11,200 − $4,053 = $7,147
- SE tax base = 0.9235 × $7,147 ≈ $6,603
- SE tax ≈ 0.153 × $6,603 ≈ $1,010
- Half SE tax deductible ≈ $505

