- Keep documentation: receipts for business expenses, donation receipt for Habitat, Form 1098‑E for student interest, 1099s, record of home office square footage and method of exclusive use (floorplan, photos, utility bills, rent payments).
- If you didn’t receive 1099‑NEC from clients, you still must report the income.
- Consider estimated tax payments (or increasing W‑2 withholding) to cover self‑employment tax and the income tax on the Schedule C profit to avoid underpayment penalties.
